    },
    "message": "Keep other approval blockers when correcting household links\n\nScenario previews did not store approval_blockers, so the household\ncorrection endpoint treated every non-guardian blocker as cleared. A\npreview blocked by both unaccompanied minors and an inaccessible route\ncould be corrected and approved, creating a Run.\n\nStore blockers in both scenario-preview and facility-preview drafts, and\nrefuse corrections on drafts that predate the blocker record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
